I recently joined @SecRollins, @gzchef, and the team at Tampa General Hospital to see what happens when hospitals put nutrition at the center of patient care.

@TGHCares signed our Make Hospital Food Healthier Pledge, demonstrating that healthier, delicious meals made with fresh, local ingredients can support healing and recovery.

I encourage hospitals across the country to follow Tampa General's lead and help us Make America Healthy Again.

